# Override the indexer the UI reads public data from. Unset, the UI uses the
# indexer configured in the connected wallet.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored, so an API key stays out of git),
# uncomment BOTH lines, and restart `yarn dev`: Vite reads env only at startup.
# The indexer must be on the same network as the wallet.
#
# Blockfrost needs your project id in both URLs. Mainnet:
# VITE_INDEXER_URI=https://midnight-mainnet.blockfrost.io/api/v0?project_id=<key>
# VITE_INDEXER_WS_URI=wss://midnight-mainnet.blockfrost.io/api/v0/ws?project_id=<key>
#
# For preprod, use midnight-preprod.blockfrost.io and a preprod project id.
